@startuml
 title Incident report
autonumber
actor Driver
participant "application mobile" as app
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "notification-service" as NTF
participant "route-service" as RTE
database "database of data" as DB
participant "Proveedor push" as Push
actor Guardian
actor School

Driver -> app: reports type, descripción and location
app -> GW: request of incident
GW -> NTF: creates Alert
NTF -> RTE: queries execution active and students a bordo
RTE --> NTF: students and School
NTF -> DB: saves Alert and AlertRecipient
NTF -> Push: notifies al School
Push -> School: alert of incident
NTF -> Push: notifies a guardians a bordo
Push -> Guardian: alert of the trip
NTF --> app: incident recorded
app --> Driver: confirmation
@enduml

